\newlabel{fig:6}{{6}{17}{\textbf {Architectural evolution and CST components (2017--2025).} Left panel: scatter plot of 20 ANN architectures, x-axis = year of publication, y-axis = $\CST _{\mathrm {emergent}}$. Color encodes dominant architectural innovation ($\Sc $: blue, $\Tc $: green, $\Gst $: orange). All points below L1 dashed line. Right panel: radar charts for 3 representative systems (MLP, Loihi-2, LTC/NCP) on 4 axes ($\Sc $, $\Tc $, $\Gst $, $\alpha $-normalized)}{figure.caption.17}{}}
